---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import companyData from '../../data/company.json';
---

<Layout
	title="Top Neighborhoods for Golf Cart Living in Ocala | Masters Golf Cars"
	description="Discover the best golf cart-friendly communities in Ocala, FL. Explore Ocala Palms, Golden Ocala, On Top of the World, Oak Run, and other neighborhoods where golf carts are a way of life."
>
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="bg-gray-900 text-white py-16">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
					<a href="/blog" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">Blog</a>
					<span class="text-gray-500">/</span>
					<span class="text-gray-400">Lifestyle</span>
				</div>
				<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Top Neighborhoods for Golf Cart Living in Ocala</h1>
				<div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-gray-300">
					<span>By Masters Golf Cars</span>
					<span>|</span>
					<time datetime="2025-01-05">January 5, 2025</time>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Article Content -->
	<article class="py-16 bg-white">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<!-- Featured Image -->
				<div class="mb-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
					<img
						src="/images/home page carts/gas-golf-cart_img_v62.webp"
						alt="Golf cart in Ocala neighborhood"
						class="w-full h-[400px] object-cover"
					/>
				</div>

				<div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
					<p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
						Ocala and Marion County are great places to own a golf cart. You do not have to live in The Villages to use a cart every day. Many Ocala neighborhoods have cart paths and let you drive your Club Car, Yamaha, EZ-GO, or Advanced EV cart to the pool, golf course, or clubhouse. Masters Golf Cars has helped these communities since 1999. Here are the best places to live the golf cart life in Ocala.
					</p>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">On Top of the World (OTOW)</h2>

					<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
						<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
							<div class="flex-1">
								<p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
									On Top of the World is one of the biggest 55+ communities in Ocala. It sits on SR-200 west of I-75. OTOW has miles of cart paths that connect homes to golf, pools, and restaurants. Most people here use their carts every day. You can drive to The Ranch Fitness Center, Circle Square Commons, or Candler Hills Golf Club without getting in your car.
								</p>
								<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Why Golf Cart Owners Love OTOW:</h4>
								<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
									<li>Cart paths go to every part of the community</li>
									<li>Easy ride to pools, restaurants, and fitness centers</li>
									<li>Many homes have garages big enough for carts</li>
									<li>Fun golf cart parades and community events</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Ocala Palms</h2>

					<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
						<p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
							Ocala Palms is a gated 55+ community off US-27 near I-75. It feels like a resort with an 18-hole golf course, big pools, and tennis courts. People use their carts to get to the clubhouse for dinner or cards with friends. The paths are smooth and well-kept. It is only a short drive from Publix and Walmart on SR-200.
						</p>
						<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Why Golf Cart Owners Love Ocala Palms:</h4>
						<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
							<li>Smooth cart paths all through the community</li>
							<li>18-hole golf course you can drive to</li>
							<li>Layout made for easy cart travel</li>
							<li>Close to stores and doctors on SR-200</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Golden Ocala Golf & Equestrian Club</h2>

					<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
						<p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
							Golden Ocala is one of the nicest places to live in Marion County. It has a famous golf course and horse stables. The homes are large and the grounds are beautiful. This is a great spot if you want a fancy cart with all the extras. The paths are perfect for showing off your custom Club Car or Advanced EV.
						</p>
						<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Why Golf Cart Owners Love Golden Ocala:</h4>
						<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
							<li>World-class golf course built for carts</li>
							<li>Fancy pool, spa, and dining all by cart</li>
							<li>Smooth, paved paths in great shape</li>
							<li>Great place for custom or luxury carts</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Oak Run Country Club</h2>

					<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
						<p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
							Oak Run is a big 55+ community with over 3,500 homes. It is off SR-200 near OTOW. Oak Run has two golf courses, so carts are a must. You can drive your cart to the Royal Oaks or Eagle's courses, then stop at the clubhouse for lunch. The community has clubs for everything, including a golf cart club.
						</p>
						<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Why Golf Cart Owners Love Oak Run:</h4>
						<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
							<li>Two 18-hole golf courses</li>
							<li>Lots of cart paths to get around</li>
							<li>Pools, gym, and clubs all by cart</li>
							<li>Active golf cart group for owners</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Spruce Creek South</h2>

					<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
						<p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
							Spruce Creek South is in southwest Marion County near Dunnellon. It is a 55+ community where you can live well without spending a lot. The 9-hole golf course is fun and the paths take you to the pool and clubhouse. Many folks here drive their carts to visit neighbors or play cards.
						</p>
						<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Why Golf Cart Owners Love Spruce Creek South:</h4>
						<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
							<li>9-hole golf course for quick rounds</li>
							<li>Cart paths connect the whole community</li>
							<li>Low fees to live here</li>
							<li>Active lifestyle with cart-friendly fun</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Candler Hills</h2>

					<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
						<p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
							Candler Hills is part of On Top of the World but has its own feel. The homes are bigger and fancier. You can use all of OTOW's paths plus the Candler Hills Golf Club. Drive your cart to the restaurant at Candler Hills for dinner with views of the course. It connects to Circle Square Commons for shopping and shows.
						</p>
						<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Why Golf Cart Owners Love Candler Hills:</h4>
						<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
							<li>Candler Hills Golf Club right there</li>
							<li>Uses all of OTOW's cart paths</li>
							<li>Restaurant and bar by cart</li>
							<li>Nice neighborhood for nicer carts</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Cherrywood</h2>

					<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
						<p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
							Cherrywood is a 55+ community off SR-200 where homes cost less. People here love their golf carts. You will see carts of all types driving to the clubhouse for bingo or to check the mail. It is friendly and fun without high costs.
						</p>
						<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Why Golf Cart Owners Love Cherrywood:</h4>
						<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
							<li>Low cost of living with cart paths</li>
							<li>Clubhouse events and card games</li>
							<li>Paths to main spots in the community</li>
							<li>All carts welcome, from simple to fancy</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Stone Creek</h2>

					<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
						<p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
							Stone Creek is a newer community near The Villages off US-441. It has modern paths and a nice golf course. Since it is close to The Villages, you can use their town squares too. Spanish Springs and Brownwood are a short cart ride away. Stone Creek gives you the best of both worlds.
						</p>
						<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Why Golf Cart Owners Love Stone Creek:</h4>
						<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
							<li>New paths built right</li>
							<li>Great golf course</li>
							<li>Close to The Villages for more fun</li>
							<li>Resort-style pool and clubhouse by cart</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Golf Cart Rules in Marion County</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						Before you drive your cart in Ocala, know the rules. Each place is a bit different:
					</p>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li><strong>Inside communities</strong> - Each HOA has its own rules, so ask them first</li>
						<li><strong>County roads</strong> - Carts may drive on roads with speed limits of 35 mph or less</li>
						<li><strong>Safety items</strong> - You may need headlights, taillights, turn signals, and mirrors</li>
						<li><strong>Driver rules</strong> - You usually need a valid driver's license</li>
						<li><strong>Registration</strong> - Some areas need you to sign up your cart</li>
					</ul>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Picking the Right Cart for Ocala</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						Think about these things when you buy a golf cart for your Ocala neighborhood:
					</p>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li><strong>Electric or gas</strong> - Most communities like electric carts because they are quiet and clean. Read our <a href="/blog/electric-vs-gas-golf-carts" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">electric vs gas guide</a></li>
						<li><strong>How many seats</strong> - Think about guests and family. 4-seat and 6-seat carts are popular</li>
						<li><strong>Lithium batteries</strong> - <a href="/blog/lithium-battery-conversion-guide" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">Lithium upgrades</a> go farther and need no water</li>
						<li><strong>Street-legal gear</strong> - If you drive on public roads, get the right lights and mirrors</li>
						<li><strong>Weather protection</strong> - Get a rain cover for storms and A/C for hot days</li>
					</ul>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Why Buy from Masters Golf Cars?</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						Masters Golf Cars is on US-441 in Belleview, between Ocala and The Villages. We have served these communities for over 25 years. We know what Ocala folks need because many of us live here too. Here is what we offer:
					</p>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li>New and used Club Car, Yamaha, EZ-GO, and Advanced EV carts</li>
						<li>Custom builds with the features you want</li>
						<li><a href="/golf-cart-repairs-ocala" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">Repair and service</a> near your home</li>
						<li><a href="/golf-cart-rentals-ocala" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">Rentals</a> when family visits</li>
						<li>Easy to reach on US-441 from OTOW, Ocala Palms, Oak Run, and Golden Ocala</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<!-- CTA Section -->
				<div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 text-center">
					<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ready to Join the Golf Cart Life?</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
						Whether you are moving to an Ocala golf cart community or need a new ride, we are here to help. Stop by Masters Golf Cars on US-441 in Belleview.
					</p>
					<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
						<a
							href="/golf-cart-inventory"
							class="bg-brand-green text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold hover:opacity-90 transition"
						>
							Browse Inventory
						</a>
						<a
							href="/contact"
							class="bg-white text-gray-900 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-gray-100 transition"
						>
							Contact Us
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Author Bio -->
				<div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
						<img
							src="/images/logos/MastersGolfCarsLogo.png"
							alt="Masters Golf Cars"
							class="w-16 h-16 object-contain"
						/>
						<div>
							<p class="font-bold text-gray-900">Masters Golf Cars</p>
							<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
								Masters Golf Cars has served Central Florida since 1999. We sell, fix, and rent golf carts in The Villages, Ocala, Belleview, and all of Marion and Sumter County.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Related Posts -->
				<div class="mt-12">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Related Articles</h3>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
						<a href="/blog/golf-cart-guide-the-villages" class="block bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition">
							<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Complete Golf Cart Guide for The Villages Residents</h4>
							<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Everything you need to know about golf cart life in The Villages.</p>
						</a>
						<a href="/blog/electric-vs-gas-golf-carts" class="block bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition">
							<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Electric vs Gas Golf Carts: Which Is Right for You?</h4>
							<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Compare the pros and cons of electric and gas-powered golf carts.</p>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</article>
</Layout>
